<section aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="scroll-mt-20 border-t border-charcoal/10 py-20 sm:py-28" id="faq"><div class="container-soft grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-6"><div class="reveal lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:col-span-4 lg:self-start"><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2 class="headline mt-4" id="faq-title">Questions, answered.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-[34ch] text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/65">Can’t find what you need? Email<!-- --> <a class="link text-charcoal" href="mailto:nullacomfort@outlook.com">nullacomfort@outlook.com</a> <!-- -->or see<!-- --> <a class="link text-charcoal" href="/pages/shipping-returns">shipping &amp; returns</a>.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6"><div class="divide-y divide-charcoal/10 border-y border-charcoal/10"><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-what-is-nuv-panel" aria-expanded="true" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-what-is-nuv-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">What is the Nolla Nuv<span class="ml-[0.02em] align-super font-sans text-[0.42em] font-normal tracking-normal">™</span> blanket?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft scale-y-0"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-what-is-nuv-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100" id="_R_k5fivbb_-what-is-nuv-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">It’s our signature blanket, made from rex rabbit velvet: a dense faux fur (no real fur) with a deep, rippled surface. It comes in six colours and three sizes, and every blanket comes with a free Nimbus<span class="ml-[0.02em] align-super font-sans text-[0.42em] font-normal tracking-normal">™</span> cloud pillow.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-sizes-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-sizes-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">What sizes are available?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-sizes-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-sizes-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">Three: 100 × 150 cm, 150 × 200 cm and 200 × 230 cm. Prices for each size are shown when you choose one.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-colours-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-colours-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">What colours are available?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-colours-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-colours-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">White, Coffee, Pink, Green, Grey and Black. Colours can look a little different from screen to screen.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-which-size-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-which-size-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">Which size should I choose?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-which-size-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-which-size-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">The 100 × 150 cm is a smaller throw for one person on a sofa or armchair. The 150 × 200 cm and 200 × 230 cm give you more to wrap up in or share, and more coverage across a bed or sofa. Beds and sofas vary, so we’d suggest measuring yours and comparing it with our size guide.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-free-pillow-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-free-pillow-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">Is the cloud pillow really free?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-free-pillow-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-free-pillow-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">Yes. Every blanket comes with one Nimbus<span class="ml-[0.02em] align-super font-sans text-[0.42em] font-normal tracking-normal">™</span> cloud pillow at no extra cost. There’s no code to enter: it’s added to your bag automatically. If you return your blanket, you’re welcome to keep the pillow.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-delivery-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-delivery-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">How does delivery work?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-delivery-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-delivery-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">We ship to the UK, the US, Canada, Mexico, Australia, New Zealand, France, Germany, Italy, Spain, Portugal, the Netherlands, Sweden, Norway and Finland, and shipping is free and tracked to all of them. We can’t deliver to other countries at the moment. You can also choose express insured shipping (£4.71) at checkout, which arrives in 4–8 business days. Orders usually arrive in 4–9 business days. Delivery times are estimates rather than guarantees, and we’ll email your tracking details as soon as your order ships.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-currency-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-currency-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">Which currency will I pay in?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-currency-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-currency-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">You can browse in your own currency using the selector at the top of the page. Orders are charged in pounds (GBP), and if your card is in another currency your card provider converts it. Prices shown in currencies other than pounds and US dollars are converted at current exchange rates, so they’re approximate. Orders delivered to the US are charged at our US prices, converted to pounds.</div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-returns-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-returns-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">Can I return my order?<!-- --></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-returns-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-returns-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">Yes. You can cancel for any reason within 14 days of receiving your order. Faulty or incorrect items are on us. Full details are on our Shipping &amp; Returns page.<!-- --></div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-care-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-care-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">How should I care for the blanket?<!-- --></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-care-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-care-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">We’re confirming full care instructions with our maker and will add them here. Until then, please follow the care label sewn into your blanket.<!-- --></div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-together-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-together-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">Will my blanket and pillow arrive together?<!-- --></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-together-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-together-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">Not always. Your blanket and pillow may arrive in separate packages, and you may receive separate tracking for each.<!-- --></div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="font-sans"><button aria-controls="_R_k5fivbb_-contact-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 text-left text-charcoal min-h-[4.25rem] py-5 text-[1.02rem] sm:text-[1.08rem]" id="_R_k5fivbb_-contact-button" type="button"><span class="transition-colors group-hover:text-mocha">How can I contact Nolla?<!-- --></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-charcoal/70"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft"></span></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="_R_k5fivbb_-contact-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0" id="_R_k5fivbb_-contact-panel" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="max-w-[62ch] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 pb-6 text-[0.98rem]">Email us at nullacomfort@outlook.com. For questions about an order, include your name and the email you used at checkout so we can find it quickly.<!-- --></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>

